epos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":1088354,"digest":"sha256:2f03089043d55565417d13bfc070bc97909c446b413abfefe2f28d0afbb1aa6e","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-11-23T16:54:03Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:54:03Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/releases/download/v0.13.2/checkwash.pyz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taipei49314/checkwash/tarball/v0.13.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/taipei49314/checkwash/zipball/v0.13.2","body":"CheckWash 0.13.2 improves how Python PRs are scanned. A test that imports an existing project module or moves without changing what it checks can receive the appropriate verdict. When moving a test changes which same-named module it calls, the scanner compares the providers at the old and new paths. The CLI also identifies invalid Git ranges, shows the Ruff rules changed in each file, and distinguishes active findings from reviewed exemptions.\n\nOn two changes in the same 7,104-file Django checkout, the final optimization reduced median CLI time from 16.09 to 7.14 seconds and from 15.70 to 6.86 seconds, with identical JSON, stderr and exit codes. The medians come from four fresh Windows Python 3.12.14 processes per engine and range. The 3,600-commit comparison against the public 0.13.1 zipapp also returned identical exits and streams, including the two existing symlink errors. [Measurements and coverage](https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/blob/4ecb0b0efa2febe7dcacae7f4114e98877205128/docs/releases/v0.13.2-public-launch.md) · [Known limits](https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/blob/4ecb0b0efa2febe7dcacae7f4114e98877205128/docs/KNOWN-ISSUES-v0.13.2.md)\n\nFor the recommended CLI version, standalone download and GitHub Action pin, use the [verified installation guide](https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/blob/main/docs/install.md).\n\n[Verified release tag](https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/runs/137811441218) · [Cross-platform source verification](https://github.com/taipei49314/checkwash/actions/runs/45190644444)\n"}